
Package: neugene
Title: Genome-Wide Association Analysis Using GLM with PCA Correction
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R:
    person("Bipin", "Neupane", email = "neupanebpn63@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for genome-wide association studies (GWAS)
    using general linear models (GLM), with and without principal component
    analysis (PCA) correction for population structure. Includes tools for
    association testing, visualization of GWAS results, and evaluation
    of model performance using example datasets.
